 "audit": "Old /size-guide URL 404s. Bust from Tops, waist and hip from Bottoms. Tops prints L waist 31 1/2-34 1/2\" but its cm view (82.55-87.63) and the Bottoms chart both give 32 1/2-34 1/2\", so 32.5 is used. Stored chart was far too large and shifted: M 101/84/106 -> 96.5-99.1/76.2-80/101.6-105.4; L 108/91/113 -> 102.9-106.7/82.6-87.6/109.2-114.3; XXS 85/68/90 -> 81.3-83.8/61-63.5/86.4-88.9. 2X and 3X added. Stored us was letters; now the printed numbers. UK/EU clothing conversions removed (not published). Petite rows not included."
